      "width": 640,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Today vs Cloud GitHub App\nPAT connect creates new repos public (`GITHUB_REPO_VISIBILITY=public`).\nWSO2 Cloud’s GitHub App is not this connect.\nUntil AE takes it, repos stay public.\nIntended: only Admin saves the PAT. Today any org login token can (see I01).",
